      sr: "Dva centralna kvarta koja se stalno porede, a traže različite kupce. Građevinski fond, prevoz, škole, parking i opsezi cena — bez uglađenih fraza.",
      en: "Two central districts that are endlessly compared, yet suit different buyers. Building stock, transport, schools, parking and price bands — without the gloss.",
